  "description": "Model review loop: a section box isolates a pump skid, a viewpoint stores it, a redline cloud and an arrow are attached, an issue with a comment is raised, then the referenced entity is deleted so check_review reports a stale viewpoint and an open issue; the agent marks it resolved, closing it is a human gate. Section-box membership is exact AABB arithmetic.",
